	quest.305EC88CC3DFD3AE.quest_desc: [
		"Create a &eTuff Golem&r to show off items. Build it with &bTuff&r, any &bWool&r, and a &bCarved Pumpkin&r or &bJack o’Lantern&r."
		""
		"It wanders and may sleep at its spawn."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Holding items can attract mobs (e.g. &bWheat&r for &2Sheep&r). Use &bHoneycomb&r to fix it in place."
		""
		"Heal it by using &bTuff&r for &e+5 health&r."
	]
