	quest.44D0A2AF3E0E0696.quest_desc: [
		"At night, an active &dCreaking Heart&r spawns a &eCreaking&r. It attacks players but cannot move while seen by any player."
		""
		"The linked &dCreaking Heart&r protects it from all damage, and breaking the heart kills the &eCreaking&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Hitting a protected &eCreaking&r causes &bResin Clumps&r to grow on nearby &bPale Oak Logs&r."
	]
